    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 0.5.3: 
  * Fix deprecation warnings
  * Shrink the idle window
  * Fixup comments
  * clear WM_TAKE_FOCUS from window flags
  * Move the WM_TAKE_FOCUS removal to syncWindowId()
  * Request autostart through the Background portal in Flatpak
  * Show the bridge in the application menu
  * Tidy up translatable strings
  * Fix build with KPipeWire older than 6.7
  * Document how to install the bridge (forwarded request 1379147 from Kieltux)</comment>
